# Embedding-model download activity, relative to the 2022 level.
#
# Source: the "sentence-transformers" row of downloads_by_namespace_year.csv in
# the Hugging Face dataset XciD/hf-model-downloads-by-origin-2022-2026,
# revision 1bed1b4, accessed 2026-11-19.  Its README describes the figures as
# GET and HEAD requests for particular model files, counted from archived Hub
# access logs; these are the published aggregates and we have not verified the
# underlying logs.  So this is a file-download count for one namespace, not a
# count of users, of API calls, or of industry-wide usage, and the namespace
# also hosts static (non-Transformer) embedding models.  The source table's
# 2026 row covers only part of the year and is excluded here rather than drawn
# as a short year.
#
#   relative(year) = annual_downloads(year) / annual_downloads(2022)
#
# year  annual_downloads  relative
2022   206297891   1.0000
2023   315253801   1.5281
2024  1960879690   9.5051
2025  2747223348  13.3168
